# The four endings, one conversation each.

@conversation ending_bad chapter=Ending title=Blocked
@scene CHAT channel=thread_miki day=2 time=23:59 music=night_ambience.mp3

timestamp
  en: Day 2 — 11:59 PM
miki:frown typing=4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  en: you didn't tell her.
miki typing=2.9s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  en: it's ok. i'll find someone else.
system
  en: This number is no longer available.
ending end_03_bad BAD
  en: Ending 3: Blocked
  summary en: Miki's message never reached Luna. The unknown number went quiet for good.


@conversation ending_good chapter=Ending title="Almost There"
@scene CHAT channel=thread_nora day=2 time=20:10 music=night_ambience.mp3

timestamp
  en: Day 2 — 8:10 PM
nora typing=2.2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  en: so... are you going to explain what happened at the café today?
player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3
  en: long story. i think i helped someone.
nora:smile typing=3.2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  en: Luna messaged me. she said thank you. and that she still wonders what Miki really wanted to say 🥲
ending end_02_good GOOD
  en: Ending 2: Almost There
  summary en: Luna found some peace, but Miki's full message stayed unsaid.


@conversation ending_secret chapter=Ending title="Our Year"
@scene VN day=2 time=10:30 bg=cg_luna_cafe.png music=sunny.mp3 textbox=nvl

narration
  en: Luna opens the diary to the last page.
narration
  en: Two handwritings.{w=600} One of them is {i}still wet{/i}.
miki:smile [left]
  en: "See you at our table, Luna. Same time next year."
luna:smile [right]
  en: She's here, isn't she? ...Hi, Miki.
ending end_04_secret SECRET
  en: Secret Ending: Our Year
  summary en: With the photo and the passcode, you gave Miki and Luna one last morning together.


@conversation ending_true chapter=Ending title="Unsent Apology"
@scene VN day=2 time=10:02 bg=bg_restaurant.png music=sunny.mp3

miki:smile [center]
  en: Tell her... thank you. I can go now.
stage
  weather sakura
  zoom 1.15 focus=center duration=1.2s
luna:smile [right]
  en: It's warm in here all of a sudden. Is that strange?
stage
  hide miki transition=slide_up duration=1.2s
  zoom 1 duration=1.2s
narration
  en: Your phone buzzes one last time. The unknown number is gone from your contacts.
ending end_01_true TRUE
  en: Ending 1: Unsent Apology
  summary en: You delivered Miki's apology. Luna finally got to let her go.
